{"tuid":"qk9zxb8rx89f5h","pageVersion":2,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2024-03-22"},"identification":{"ifids":["8A9B45CA-089C-4AF0-B282-F00445EF0DB4"]},"bibliographic":{"title":"Not Quite a Sunset - a hypertext opera","author":"Kyle Rowan","language":"en","firstpublished":"2017-04-07","description":"On an orbital space station in a distant star system, Dr. Sara Reyes leads a small team tasked with surveying a planet for potential settlement. A science-fiction story set to an original musical score.  <br> <br>Author&#039;s Comment: &quot;&#039;Not Quite a Sunset&#039; began as my dissertation project, investigating how a listener might be able to influence the plot (and by extension the music) of an opera through their choices. Hypertext seemed a natural medium to facilitate the choices of an individual listener, and the resulting piece is essentially a story with a soundtrack. Because every passage is set against and often timed to coordinate with music, headphones are recommended. This version for the 2017 Spring Thing Festival is a preview of the first two chapters; the full piece will be released in Summer 2017.&quot;"},"contacts":{"url":"http://penguinmanmusic.com/tag/not-quite-a-sunset/"},"ifdb":{"tuid":"qk9zxb8rx89f5h","pageversion":2,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=qk9zxb8rx89f5h","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=qk9zxb8rx89f5h&version=2"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"http://penguinmanmusic.com/nqas/nqas-0187.html","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"http://penguinmanmusic.com/nqas/nqas-0187.html","playOnlineUrl":"http://penguinmanmusic.com/nqas/nqas-0187.html","title":"Play online","desc":"At the author's website - post-Spring-Thing version.","isGame":true,"format":"hypertextgame"},{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/springthing/2017/NotQuiteASunsetAHypertextOpera.zip","playOnlineUrl":"https://unbox.ifarchive.org/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.